r PLC in Georgetown County","/arc-plc/south-carolina/georgetown-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids October to November and November to December each came in under 90% of normal in 37 of 75 years. This year has run short so far, with March to April 2026 at 16% of normal on the middle of the grids. Grid 15802 had its driest year in 1954 at 61% of normal.</p>"}
